<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
    <title>Indonesia Survey Data Analysis Dashboards</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #f1f4f8;
            color: #18283b;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.5;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .main-container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .page-title {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .page-title h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: #18283b;
        }
        .page-title p {
            color: #596b7e;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .nav-cards {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .nav-btn {
            display: block;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #125b76;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #dbe3ec;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(20, 43, 73, 0.05);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
            position: relative;
        }
        .nav-btn:hover {
            border-color: #126b83;
            background: #edf6fa;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(20, 43, 73, 0.1);
        }
        .nav-btn .description {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #607185;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .nav-btn::after {
            content: "→";
            position: absolute;
            right: 24px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #126b83;
            opacity: 0.6;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        .nav-btn:hover::after {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(4px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main-container">
        <header class="page-title">
            <h1>Indonesia Survey Data Dashboards</h1>
            <p>Please select an analysis report to view:</p>
        </header>

        <nav class="nav-cards">
            <a href="selected_questions.html" class="nav-btn">
                Selected Questions Analysis
                <span class="description">View national and Java provincial survey questions and charts</span>
            </a>

            <a href="demographics.html" class="nav-btn">
                Demographic Data
                <span class="description">Basic demographic distribution data of respondents</span>
            </a>

            <a href="donation_comparison.html" class="nav-btn">
                Donation Comparison Analysis
                <span class="description">Comparative analysis of donation behaviors across regions and organizations</span>
            </a>
        </nav>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
